	(descr "USB-C PD source module (XPM52C, 'PD 65W' module, 20x32 mm). DC input on the two plated corner holes at the input end: pin 1 = VIN+, pin 2 = GND. USB-C PD output is a receptacle on the module itself. Module origin at board centre; USB-C end toward -Y. Geometry photo-measured from the purchased unit 2026-11-18 - VERIFY hole pitch (17.1 mm) and inset (2.0 mm) with calipers before fab.")
